{
  "id": "league-cup",
  "name": "League Cup",
  "category": "event",
  "description": {
    "text": "League Cup tournaments handed out a reverse holo Trainer card stamped with the League Cup logo, a new one for each expansion's season, with a Staff copy for those who ran them. Steam Siege's Ninja Boy was one; from the Sun & Moon season's Nest Ball on, each season had its own card, up to Quick Ball in the Sword & Shield season. Four carry an \"a\" after their number: Shining Legends' Ultra Ball 68a for the Team Up season, Forbidden Light's Beast Ring 102a for Unbroken Bonds, Unbroken Bonds' Pokégear 3.0 182a for Unified Minds, and Unified Minds' Cherish Ball 191a for Cosmic Eclipse.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: Steam Siege (TCG), additional cards",
        "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Steam_Siege_(TCG)#Additional_cards"
      },
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: Sun & Moon (TCG), additional cards",
        "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Sun_%26_Moon_(TCG)#Additional_cards"
      },
      {
